00:58:05.560 --> 00:58:07.520
<v William Burroughs>You're as good as a pimp in bed.

00:58:07.520 --> 00:58:09.280
<v Ira Glass>Co-founder Mr. Torey Malatia.

00:58:09.280 --> 00:58:09.700
<v William Burroughs>Pimp.

00:58:09.700 --> 00:58:11.560
<v Ira Glass>Torey, thank you so much.

00:58:11.560 --> 00:58:12.320
<v William Burroughs>In bed.

00:58:12.320 --> 00:58:24.030
<v Ira Glass>I'm Ira Glack-- I'm Ira. I'm Ira Glass. Back next week. Back, back, back, back. Ira Glass. Stories. More. This American Life .

00:58:24.030 --> 00:58:29.030
<v William Burroughs>In bed.
